(6. Reading: A Mysterious Robbery) Tj
T*
(Last night, a jewellery shop was robbed. The police arrived shortly after the alarm went) Tj
T*
(off. Two witnesses reported seeing a suspicious vehicle near the shop. Detectives collected) Tj
T*
(evidence and found fingerprints at the crime scene. Although the suspect tried to escape,) Tj
T*
(the police arrested him. Despite the lack of clear video footage, investigators solved the) Tj
T*
(case.) Tj
T*
(Anoche robaron en una joyería. La policía llegó poco después de que saltara la alarma. Dos) Tj
T*
(testigos declararon haber visto un vehículo sospechoso cerca de la tienda. Los detectives) Tj
T*
(recogieron pruebas y encontraron huellas en la escena del crimen. Aunque el sospechoso) Tj
T*
(intentó escapar, lo detuvieron. A pesar de la falta de imágenes claras, resolvieron el caso.) Tj
